Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The fakemeta_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
326656 bytes, SHA256 2ADA19A662F365B62F0881C08CE5C8A4FAF269313BE91604C3C29373FD141CF3,
kept as fakemeta_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over fakemeta_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
